{"Title":"An Act to limit fees charged in a rental real estate transaction","BillNumber":"H398","DocketNumber":"HD3183","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"E_U1","Name":"Erika Uyterhoeven","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/E_U1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:36:54.75"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"E_U1","Name":"Erika Uyterhoeven","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/E_U1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T10:36:54.75"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H398/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Uyterhoeven of Somerville, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 398) of Erika Uyterhoeven for legislation to limit fees charged by licensed brokers or salespersons in rental real estate transactions.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.","DocumentText":"\tSection 87DDD½ of chapter 112, of the General Laws is hereby amended by adding the following sentence:- No licensed broker or salesperson shall charge a tenant a fee for services relating to finding a dwelling accommodation or for any other service unless the tenant has sought out and hired that broker or salesperson to provide the tenant with such services.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}